{"format":"hologram.registry.artifact/v1","id":"mcr.microsoft.com/azureml/mlflow-huggingface-ubuntu20.04-py38-nvidia-gpu-inference","fetched":"2026-09-25T12:12:09.256Z","source":{"name":"Microsoft Artifact Registry","api":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/api/v1/catalog/azureml/mlflow-huggingface-ubuntu20.04-py38-nvidia-gpu-inference/details?reg=mar","page":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/en-us/product/azureml/mlflow-huggingface-ubuntu20.04-py38-nvidia-gpu-inference/about"},"readme":"## About\nPrebuilt Docker container images for inference are used when deploying a model with [Azure Machine Learning](https://docs.microsoft.com/azure/machine-learning/). The images are prebuilt with required python packages. The docker images are optimized for inference and provided for CPU and GPU based scenarios.\n\n[Learn more](https://docs.microsoft.com/azure/machine-learning/concept-prebuilt-docker-images-inference) about the images.\n\n## Featured Tags\n\n- `:latest` for CPU and GPU inference images\n\nCPU/GPU | OS Version | Python Version | MCR Path\n --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\nCPU | Ubuntu 20.04 | Python 3.8 | `mcr.microsoft.com/azureml/minimal-ubuntu20.04-py38-cpu-inference:latest` |\nCPU | Ubuntu 20.04 | Python 3.9 | `mcr.microsoft.com/azureml/minimal-ubuntu20.04-py39-cpu-inference:latest` |\nCPU | Ubuntu 22.04 | Python 3.9 | `mcr.microsoft.com/azureml/minimal-ubuntu22.04-py39-cpu-inference:latest` |\nGPU | Ubuntu 22.04 | Python 3.9 | `mcr.microsoft.com/azureml/minimal-ubuntu22.04-py39-cuda11.8-gpu-inference:latest` |\n\n## Usage\n- [Azure/azureml-examples](https://github.com/Azure/azureml-examples/tree/main/tutorials): Azure Machine Learning examples repository.\n- [Prebuilt docker image for Inference](https://docs.microsoft.com/azure/machine-learning/concept-prebuilt-docker-images-inference)\n- [Extend Prebuilt docker image](https://docs.microsoft.com/azure/machine-learning/how-to-extend-prebuilt-docker-image-inference)\n- [Learn more about Azure Machine Learning inference HTTP Server](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/machine-learning/how-to-inference-server-http?view=azureml-api-2)\n\n## Support\n- [Troubleshooting Guide](https://docs.microsoft.com/azure/machine-learning/how-to-troubleshoot-prebuilt-docker-image-inference)\n\n## License\n\nLegal Notice: [Container License Information](https://aka.ms/mcr/osslegalnotice). By downloading these images, you agree to the terms of the license agreement.","readmeBase":null,"publisher":{"name":"Microsoft","url":"https://mcr.microsoft.com/","official":true,"verified":true},"registered":null,"updated":"2024-01-22T18:07:23.6353724+00:00","categories":[],"keywords":[],"license":"MIT","links":[],"maintainers":[],"stats":{"pulls":null,"pullsText":"528K+","stars":null},"mediaTypes":[],"contentTypes":[],"storage":null,"tags":[{"name":"20240122.v1","digest":"sha256:0ce6e40136bf3358e9278fb4e2633152353cb7c7773f34c4ed97ab0efe2fe2cf","pushed":"2024-01-22T18:07:24.0000000+00:00","size":29327,"platforms":["linux/amd64"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.v2+json","status":null},{"name":"20240108.v1","digest":"sha256:0ce6e40136bf3358e9278fb4e2633152353cb7c7773f34c4ed97ab0efe2fe2cf","pushed":"2024-01-08T22:19:13.0000000+00:00","size":29327,"platforms":["linux/amd64"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.v2+json","status":null},{"name":"20240101.v1","digest":"sha256:0ce6e40136bf3358e9278fb4e2633152353cb7c7773f34c4ed97ab0efe2fe2cf","pushed":"2024-01-02T17:12:01.0000000+00:00","size":29327,"platforms":["linux/amd64"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.v2+json","status":null},{"name":"20231218.v2","digest":"sha256:0ce6e40136bf3358e9278fb4e2633152353cb7c7773f34c4ed97ab0efe2fe2cf","pushed":"2023-12-19T03:21:28.0000000+00:00","size":29327,"platforms":["linux/amd64"],"mediaType":"application/vnd.docker.distribution.manifest.v2+json","status":null},{"name":"20231207.v2","digest":"sha256:0ce6e40136bf3358e9278fb4e2633152353cb7c7773f34c4ed97ab0efe2fe2cf",